<title>JAPAN: Nippon Pillar - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Pillar - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.98		vs	    7.52</p>
<p> Operating	  922    million    vs	  957    million</p>
<p> Current	    950    million    vs	  893    million</p>
